Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.48,0:02:03.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will see if it is confirmed or not. We\Nwarn: this is unofficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:08.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,That Pablo Escobar Gaviria has just\Nsurrendered at the governor's office of\NAntioquia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,How reliable is the source?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.18,0:02:13.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, a very serious source, an authority in\NAntioquia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:21.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,From here the prison can be seen much more\Nclearly, and the second
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,helicopter has landed. The second helicopter\Nhas landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:51.98,SubHi,,0,0,0,,As a consequence of the policy of peace and\Nsubmission to justice of the President and his\Ncabinet,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:03:03.58,SubHi,,0,0,0,,I have decided to submit to decrees 2047,\N2147, 2372 and 3030 of 1990
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:10.78,SubHi,,0,0,0,,and 303 of 1991, backed by the Attorney\NGeneral of the Nation, by [unclear]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:15.78,SubHi,,0,0,0,,the Supreme Court of Justice and the vast\Nmajority of the people of Colombia.
